**The Crisis Manager**

In the sweltering heat of the economic downturn, Maya found herself at the helm of a small, community-driven data storage facility. As the owner, she knew that her business's survival depended on adapting to the changing needs of her clients. Amidst the chaos, Maya implemented a novel payment structure that would revolutionize the way people managed their expenses.

**The Crisis Scenario**

As the economy teetered on the brink of collapse, many of Maya's clients faced unexpected financial hardships. Some were struggling to make ends meet, while others had seen their income dwindle to near-zero. In this environment, Maya recognized an opportunity to not only retain her clients but also prove her commitment to their well-being.

